    <string name="about_title">Help</string>
    <string name="about_message">Core features:\n\n• Move the mouse pointer with the TV remote D-pad; hold a direction key for continuous movement. Adjust pointer sensitivity and size in Other Settings.\n• Press OK to click; hold OK for a long press.\n• In Other Settings → Shortcut Settings, configure multi-key combinations or timed holds for opening settings and enabling Fixed Scroll. Once Fixed Scroll is active, hold Back for 3 seconds to turn it off.\n• Customize separate pointer appearances for normal and Fixed Scroll modes, or share one appearance.\n• If the accessibility service is interrupted and the remote stops responding, disable TV Mouse in system Accessibility settings and enable it again.\n• Supports Simplified Chinese and English.</string>
